The same behaviour with `watchEffect`

```js
const { computed, watchEffect, ref } = Vue;

const source = ref(0);
const isZero = computed(() => source.value === 0);

watchEffect(() => console.log(isZero.value)); // fires every second

setInterval(() => source.value++, 1000);
```

